name:_1400
params:Vector3 坐标,Float 整体缩放,Long 摧毁模式
lines:
if{fun long.equal(var 摧毁模式:Long 0)
  Color 颜色1=fun create.color(Color 125,178,255,255,颜色1400_0)
  Float 特效缩放=fun float.multiply(Float 0.25:var 整体缩放)
  act 336./特效发射器.发射(var 坐标:Float 46:var 特效缩放)
  Float 粒子1_1400s=fun float.multiply(Float 0.5:var 整体缩放)
  Float 粒子数1_1400s=fun create.float(Float 20)
  act 336./碎片粒子发射器.发射碎片(var 坐标:var 粒子1_1400s:var 粒子数1_1400s:var 颜色1:Float 5:var 简化特效生效)
  act 1101./主界面.播放音效(String 冰块爆炸.ogg:Float 1)
}
